00:33:12.660 --> 00:33:19.310
"Hello," said the tractor. "I'm Terence. I'm plowing. I'm Thomas. I'm pulling a train."

00:33:19.310 --> 00:33:25.670
"What ugly wheels you've got." "They're not ugly. They're caterpillars," said Terence.

00:33:25.670 --> 00:33:30.000
"I can go anywhere. I don't need rails." "I don't want to go anywhere."

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:36.250
