00:34:00.280 --> 00:34:05.180
"You'll need your snowplow for the next journey, Thomas," said his driver.

00:34:05.180 --> 00:34:09.880
"Snow is silly soft stuff. It won't stop me."

00:34:09.880 --> 00:34:16.440
A snowplow was heavy and uncomfortable and made Thomas cross.

00:34:16.440 --> 00:34:23.070
He shook it and he banged it, and when they got back, it was so damaged that the driver had to take it off.

00:34:23.070 --> 00:34:30.000
