00:35:16.100 --> 00:35:22.970
I rushed into a tunnel thinking how clever he was, but there was trouble ahead.

00:35:22.970 --> 00:35:28.820
Cinders and ashes, said Thomas. I'm stuck.

00:35:28.820 --> 00:35:30.000
