00:35:37.570 --> 00:35:42.070
The guard went back for help, while everyone else tried to dig the snow away.

00:35:42.070 --> 00:35:46.730
But as fast as they dug, more snow slipped down until Thomas was nearly buried.

00:35:46.730 --> 00:35:49.680
"Oh, my wheels and coupling rods!

00:35:49.680 --> 00:35:52.870
